# Strong Middle RN — Skills Roadmap

**Nguồn:** `interview/viliha.mdc` · `coding/qa-bank.mdc`  
**Thứ tự:** build app từ đầu → production · **Stack:** 2025–2026 (không deprecated)

```
Cách học mỗi tuần:  Đọc (search)  →  Làm (demo)  →  Nói (60s VN+EN)  →  Đo (STT 12+)
```

---

## Bản đồ nhanh

| Phase | STT | Mục tiêu level |
|:-----:|:---:|----------------|
| **A · Nền** | 01–05 | Middle vững — UI, hooks, list |
| **B · App logic** | 06–11 | State, API, auth, offline |
| **C · Strong Middle** | 12–17 | Perf, kiến trúc, push, deep link |
| **D · Production** | 18–21 | Test, Sentry, EAS, CI |

**Middle → Strong Middle 2:** A+B bắt buộc · C = khác biệt · D = được tin ship

---

## Phase A — Nền (01–05)

### 01 · TypeScript & JS hiện đại
- **Stack:** TypeScript · ES2023 (async/await, generics)
- **Why:** Type-safe — nền cho mọi layer phía sau
- **Search:** `TypeScript for React Native developers 2026`

### 02 · RN core & layout
- **Stack:** RN 0.7x · Expo SDK · Flexbox
- **Why:** Component tree, props/state, dựng UI cơ bản
- **Search:** `React Native Expo crash course 2026`

### 03 · Hooks (render vs commit)
- **Stack:** `useState` · `useEffect` · `useRef` · rules of hooks
- **Why:** Tránh stale closure, effect loop, re-render thừa
- **Search:** `React useEffect dependency array pitfalls`

### 04 · Navigation
- **Stack:** React Navigation v7 · Expo Router
- **Why:** Stack / tab / drawer, nested nav, params
- **Search:** `Expo Router vs React Navigation 2026`

### 05 · List & keys
- **Stack:** FlatList · FlashList
- **Why:** List lớn mượt · `keyExtractor` = `id` (không index)
- **Search:** `FlashList vs FlatList React Native`
- **Drill:** `qa-bank` Q3.1 · `viliha` Q13

---

## Phase B — App logic (06–11)

### 06 · Styling & design tokens
- **Stack:** NativeWind v4 · StyleSheet · dark mode
- **Why:** Đồng bộ Figma, scale theme, không hardcode hex
- **Search:** `NativeWind v4 design tokens dark mode`

### 07 · Client state
- **Stack:** Zustand · Redux Toolkit · Context (đúng chỗ)
- **Why:** Auth flag, theme, UI flow — app sở hữu data
- **Search:** `Zustand vs Redux Toolkit when to use`
- **Drill:** `viliha` Q1

### 08 · Server state
- **Stack:** TanStack Query v5 (key, staleTime, invalidate)
- **Why:** Cache / refetch / retry — không tự viết tay
- **Search:** `TanStack Query v5 React Native caching`
- **Drill:** `viliha` Q1–Q2 · `qa-bank` Q2.1

### 09 · API & errors
- **Stack:** Axios/fetch · interceptor · Zod
- **Why:** 1 client, 401 refresh, map 4xx/5xx/offline
- **Search:** `axios interceptor refresh token React Native`
- **Drill:** `viliha` Q15 · `qa-bank` Q5.x

### 10 · Auth & secure storage
- **Stack:** Expo SecureStore · Keychain/Keystore · biometric
- **Why:** Refresh token an toàn, không lộ PII
- **Search:** `React Native secure token storage Keychain`
- **Drill:** `viliha` Q10

### 11 · Offline storage
- **Stack:** MMKV · `expo-sqlite` / `op-sqlite` · NetInfo
- **Why:** Read offline, queue write, sync khi online
- **Search:** `MMKV vs AsyncStorage SQLite React Native`
- **Drill:** `viliha` Q10–Q12

---

## Phase C — Strong Middle (12–17)

### 12 · Performance & profiling
- **Stack:** React DevTools Profiler · RN DevTools · Hermes
- **Why:** Đo trước — memo, windowSize, getItemLayout, bundle
- **Search:** `React Native DevTools profiling performance`
- **Drill:** `viliha` Q13 · `qa-bank` Q3.1–Q3.4

### 13 · Animation & gesture
- **Stack:** Reanimated 3 · Gesture Handler
- **Why:** 60fps trên UI thread, gesture mượt
- **Search:** `React Native Reanimated 3 tutorial`

### 14 · New Architecture
- **Stack:** Fabric · TurboModules · JSI · Hermes (RN 0.76+)
- **Why:** Hiểu bỏ Bridge, startup & native interop nhanh hơn
- **Search:** `React Native New Architecture Fabric TurboModule`
- **Drill:** `qa-bank` Q1.5 · Q3.3

### 15 · Push notifications
- **Stack:** Expo Notifications · FCM · APNs
- **Why:** Token → backend → tap → đúng screen
- **Search:** `Expo push notification FCM APNs end to end`
- **Drill:** `viliha` Q6–Q9

### 16 · Deep linking
- **Stack:** RN linking config · Universal/App Links
- **Why:** URL/push → screen · cold start · queue khi chưa login
- **Search:** `React Native deep linking universal links`
- **Drill:** `viliha` Q8

### 17 · Clean Architecture (practical)
- **Stack:** Feature folder · repository · DTO → domain mapper
- **Why:** Dependency inward, scale không spaghetti
- **Search:** `Clean Architecture React Native feature folder`
- **Drill:** `viliha` Q5

---

## Phase D — Production (18–21)

### 18 · Testing
- **Stack:** Jest · RNTL · MSW
- **Why:** Unit domain · integration UI · mock API
- **Search:** `React Native Testing Library MSW 2026`
- **Drill:** `qa-bank` Topic 7

### 19 · Observability
- **Stack:** Sentry · Firebase Analytics · Error Boundary
- **Why:** Crash production, breadcrumb, không log token
- **Search:** `Sentry React Native source map setup`
- **Drill:** `qa-bank` Q6.1–Q6.2

### 20 · Build & OTA
- **Stack:** EAS Build · Submit · Update · Secrets
- **Why:** Build cloud, hotfix JS không qua store review
- **Search:** `Expo EAS Build Update production workflow`
- **Drill:** `viliha` Q3

### 21 · CI/CD
- **Stack:** EAS Workflows · GitHub Actions · Fastlane
- **Why:** Build / test / release tự động, versioning
- **Search:** `EAS Workflows CI CD React Native`

