## Deprecated → dùng thay

| ❌ Cũ | ✅ Mới |
|--------|--------|
| Flipper | React Native DevTools |
| Saga/thunk fetch mọi thứ | TanStack Query |
| `createAsyncThunk` + cache tay | Query key + invalidate |
| AsyncStorage token | SecureStore |
| `keyExtractor` = index | Stable `id` |
| Class component | Function + hooks |

